(text "LED & LOGIC OUTPUT" (at 160.02 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "9c500746-e83f-496c-8ae1-f04e90fe7a2d"))
(text "HOW IT WORKS\nApply regulated +5 V at J1: pin 1 = +5 V, pin 2 = GND.\nR1, R2 and C1 set about 0.99 Hz (0.54 s high / 0.47 s low).\nThe LED flashes; J2 pin 1 is the pulse output, pin 2 is GND.\nC3 decouples U1; C4 buffers the supply. C2 bypasses CONT.\nConnect only logic inputs at J2; this is not a power driver." (at 25.4 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "4f4ce40e-4e59-4e20-bf7a-d36129cfc4d3"))
